SUMMARY:Dormition pilgrimage at Chrysoskalitissa Monastery
LOCATION:Chrysoskalitissa\, Crete (Chania)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The white monastery on its rock five kilometres from Elafonisi is the big Dormition pilgrimage of western Chania: vespers on the 14th with a Cretan glenti below the monastery (Kounalis and Georgiladakis in 2026)\, then the morning liturgy on the 15th. The approach road is single-track and fills with cars\, so come before sunset and expect to walk the last stretch.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#chrysoskalitissa-dormition-pilgrimage-at-chrysoskalitissa-mo
